who can use a magical amulet to zap all sorts of things, including enemies and switches!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Izzy</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864880/extras/198955dc32d39799b6fe62d870391d9b.avif?t=1751940772\" width=240 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cow girl who specializes in using brute force. She can destroy walls, ram into enemies, and help you get into all sorts of hidden areas. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Rosa</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864880/extras/8f709e235821fff004056400dfc7fea3.avif?t=1751940772\" width=240 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small moth girl who is skilled with swordplay and flight. It can use its wings to reach high areas and blow deadly gusts of wind. It can also repel enemy projectiles with it's sword!</p>",
